sequenceDiagram
    participant device as Their device
    participant relay as Your relay
    participant dns as DNS provider

    Note over device,relay: Invite for alice.example.com
    device->>relay: Redeem invite
    relay-->>device: Exchanged for<br/>secure device key

    loop When Alice's IP changes
        device->>relay: Notify dnspoke server
        relay->>dns: Update DNS record
        dns-->>relay: Record saved
        relay-->>device: Update confirmed
    end
